WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:35.840
"An Unforgettable Day"

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:03.490
At the Royal Palace in Samarta, the capital of Raginei...

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:08.370
the coronation of the new King Somand Iliya Di Raginei is about to be held.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:13.810
Guests and leaders from many countries have been invited to the event...

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:17.380
and a magnificent memorial ceremony has been planned.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:25.380
Domestically, the streets are alight with flags and decorations for the coronation...

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:28.470
and a celebratory mood prevails.

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:33.720
For the people of Raginei, it looks like today will be an unforgettable day. In addition--

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.480
Clueless optimism...

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:49.080
Who's there!

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:53.010
I heard you load your gun...

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:55.540
if I were an enemy, you'd be full of holes.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.790
Hey, everyone. Sorry to worry you.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:06.060
--Lieutenant Noei! 
--Lieutenant, sir!

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:10.040
I thought I was dreaming when I heard you were safe.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.370
Wow, it's been a month...

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:22.870
This area feels a lot livelier than last time...

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:26.420
Probably 'cause travel restrictions have been loosened for the coronation.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.580
Right, Lee-Leng?

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:34.120
Lee-Leng...

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.310
Master Lee-Leng...

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:41.090
<i>He's always like this, lately...</i>

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:46.480
<i>When he looks like that, he's off in a world I don't understand...</i>

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:51.730
<i>I've never seen him look so lost...</i>

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.900
<i>When this Husband Hunting Game is over...</i>

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.310
<i>Lee-Leng's contract with Dad will end, too.</i>

00:04:01.610 --> 00:04:06.100
<i>Maybe, like before, I'll only get to see him a few times a year...</i>

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:12.380
<i>But if the game doesn't end soon, it'll be trouble...</i>

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:17.050
The destiny you are going to have to bear...

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:19.000
is an even heavier one.

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.220
What "destiny?"

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.370
When your future husband is sitting there...

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.680
then I'll tell you.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.110
<i>What does he mean, my destiny?</i>

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:37.400
<i>If my Dad calls it heavy...</i>

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.100
<i>it means heavy as lead...</i>

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.090
Hey...

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.600
Hey!

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:49.290
Would you two please try to lighten up?

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:54.010
Isn't it enough to have Rumaty be the gloomy one, back in America?

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.120
Rumaty...

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:59.870
The poor guy can't come back to his own country.

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:04.230
<i>That's right... he's all alone...</i>

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:08.760
<i>Compared to that, my problems are just...</i>

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:11.720
Yeah, you're right!

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.250
We've got to pep up.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:14.490
That's it!

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:17.150
Driver, take us by the market.

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:18.740
Kajika?

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:23.060
I'm going to cook some food to cheer us up!

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:26.050
Oh--oh God, no...

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:50.740
It is! It's the "Stamina Soup" again!

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:52.830
Better resign yourself to it...

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.850
N--no...

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.300
Harry...

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:02.330
Hello?

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:06.290
I need to talk to you about something... could you come alone?

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:09.310
How about having dinner with me?

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:17.280
With pleasure.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:20.490
Dinner sounds good.

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:24.160
I'm afraid some business came up...

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:26.950
Too bad...

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:28.190
Until later.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:33.300
C--coward!

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:37.370
I--it's not fair...

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:39.770
why am I the only sacrifice?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.250
Eugene...

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.040
What? What's that smell?

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:54.320
Done!

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.060
My sympathies...

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:02.200
Mustafa, you've arrived!

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:04.480
Just in time. Soup?

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:07.320
Soup? That's the smell?

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:11.080
My special Stamina Soup! It has a liver base.

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:12.800
You made it?

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:15.440
Uh-huh. Try some.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.830
Miss Kajika, wait--

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:25.490
Eugene is a gourmet!

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:28.370
To give him... how can you be so cruel?

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:31.340
But he's having some now...

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:37.710
Well. It's nothing inedible.

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:40.380
Huh? You must be joking...

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:55.040
H--hey, now...

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:59.940
Love... it can overcome anything...

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:08.540
Lee-Leng! Over here.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:17.400
I'd heard you were arriving in Raginei later tonight.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:21.840
There was something I wanted to talk to you about alone.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.090
Shall we start with some drinks first?

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:27.330
"Nul Valhai..."

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:30.580
It's a Ragineian sake, cooled and drunk chilled...

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:34.000
A Ragi-language name... what does it mean?

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:35.780
"Captive Moon"

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:38.330
Suggestive, isn't it.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.920
Indeed.

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:50.880
It seems Kajika's narrowed it down to three candidates.

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.130
You've heard?

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:54.370
Yes.

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:56.100
What do you think?

00:08:56.360 --> 00:09:00.280
Whether those three are the three you chose...

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:02.250
doesn't really matter now.

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:06.580
What matters is that Kajika thinks they are.

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:10.340
It's clear that there's that much fascination.

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:14.320
But Kajika says she doesn't know.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:18.400
She's not sure if she has feelings for them as friends...

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:21.010
or as men.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:25.880
In the end they were chosen as fascinating <i>people</i>...

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:29.430
They weren't chosen as <i>men</i>.

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:31.610
She's in a pretty pickle...

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:34.130
she isn't on a Friend Hunt, after all.

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:36.700
--Harry...
--Hm?

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.330
I have something I would like to ask you.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:42.030
What is it? So formal all of a sudden.

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:47.580
I told them not to let anyone in.

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:49.770
There's no danger of being bugged, either.

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.420
Go ahead and speak.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:56.940
When you first explained...

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:59.520
this "Husband Hunting Game" to us...

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:03.700
you said there was a heavy destiny following Kajika.

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:10.990
That destiny... it's deeply tied to the Kingdom of Raginei, isn't it?

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:14.470
Oh? What makes you think so?

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:18.400
You have a mysterious connection to this country.

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:23.480
Once... when your foundation was no more than a single oil company...

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:28.000
it was rescued from its greatest crisis by the previous king, Machaty.

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:32.110
It's one of the great mysteries of the oil business.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:37.430
Why did King Machaty forsake even his own country's interests...

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:40.610
to help Burnsworth out of its crisis?

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.390
Please tell me, Harry.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:48.900
On my honor, I won't ever tell.

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:52.970
To protect Kajika from here on out, I need to know!

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.340
The former King Machaty...

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:03.330
is my real father.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.470
What?

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:13.420
To some extent, you were expecting that, weren't you?

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:19.220
Fred, the father who raised me, told me when I was 14.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:24.290
His pet theory is that, once you turn 14, you are an adult.

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:29.800
55 years ago, in New York...

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:32.280
The Crown Prince of Raginei and my mother...

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:34.730
fell in love.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:39.420
It was puppy love, but it seems it was real nonetheless.

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:43.250
I wanted to know...

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:45.450
everything.

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:48.650
Did my father know about me?

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:52.410
If he knew about me, did he love me?

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:55.680
When Burnsworth had its great crisis...

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.990
I was secretly waiting.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:00.960
For King Machaty...

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.020
for my father to act.

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:06.480
And then he acted...

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:11.430
in a form that probably meant overcoming strong resistance from all those around him.

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:14.010
For the sake of a beloved son...

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:17.160
So I decided to forgive him...

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:19.370
anything and everything.

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:23.130
He told me he lived as the King of Raginei...

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:26.750
and I decided, though I wouldn't take the throne of Raginei...

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:29.270
to become the king of another country.

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:33.090
You're close enough to king, Harry.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:37.140
However... secrets will leak out.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:42.040
No matter how you hide it, someday, somehow...

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:47.740
Kajika is a direct descendant of the royal line of Raginei.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:52.620
If this were to become public knowledge, her fate would change drastically.

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:56.570
Kajika becomes first in line for the throne...

00:12:57.200 --> 00:13:00.070
I can protect her as long as I'm around...

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:02.370
but after I'm gone...

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:05.010
Thus, the Husband Hunting Game.

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:08.130
Correct... Searching for my replacement.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.360
That's the true nature of the game.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.070
You're probably upset...

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:17.460
that you're not among Kajika's chosen three.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.030
No... that's...

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:24.190
The aim of this game...

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:29.380
is to search for the person who will love, help, and protect Kajika.

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:32.530
However, no ordinary love will do.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:37.370
Unless the man is ready to throw himself away to protect Kajika, it's not enough.

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:40.720
That's why you are excluded from the candidates.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:45.500
Your first priority is the Huang family.

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:48.050
Is it not?

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:53.960
From a young age, you had it drilled into you to think only of the good of the Huang family.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:57.090
You could not sacrifice the family for Kajika.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.980
So you can never be her husband.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:03.650
I...

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:06.680
That's why I did business with you.

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:11.840
I wanted your help... with the benefit of the Huang in mind, in exchange.

00:14:12.190 --> 00:14:16.970
You are a man of business through and through. You function only on give-and-take.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.120
But to put it conversely...

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:23.100
as long as I still benefit you, you won't betray me.

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:26.720
Isn't that right, Lee-Leng?

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:29.640
<i>Harry...</i>

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.070
<i>you...</i>

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.420
Miss Kajika!

00:14:58.280 --> 00:14:59.230
What'd you find out?

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:00.290
Right.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:04.560
It seems Master Lee-Leng and Chairman Burnsworth have already left the hotel.

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:06.440
They'll be on time, then.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:09.340
Yes, they'll arrive any moment.

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:15.990
I'm so nervous...

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:18.680
I'm glad you came, Eugene.

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:19.920
Nervous?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.980
--What for?
--Well...

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:25.680
All these foreign dignitaries, royalty...

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.000
I don't belong at all.

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:31.370
They're people, just like you. There's no need to be nervous.

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.760
It's just like you to say that...

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:38.790
Carl!

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:42.560
--Kajika?!
--Long time, no see!

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:50.590
I thought I might see you.

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:53.770
Everyone's here.

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:56.580
I--I see.

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:59.020
You're late!

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:07.820
Well, Carl, Eugene. Excuse me for the other day.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.020
Not at all.

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:10.340
Thanks for the visit.

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:12.660
Carl, let me introduce you.

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:16.290
You may recognize each other, but you may not have met yet.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.890
Lee-Leng Huang.

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:22.920
Carl Rosenthal.

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:28.020
I understand you are the son of the chairman, Nelson, and his future successor.

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:30.690
My father has plenty of life left in him.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:32.980
--I wish him good health.
--My thanks.

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:36.010
Say, take a look over there...

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:39.740
Oh? This is a rare spectacle, indeed.

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:44.360
Burnsworth and Rosenthal, assembled face-to-face.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:47.410
Psst, Eugene...

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:51.250
Eddie!

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.350
I see you made it in...

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:59.040
I'm working part-time as an interpreter for the News channel.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:04.230
Since I speak even a little Ragi, I'm a hot commodity.

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:06.400
So... what's your business?

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:10.600
Isaac Noei is in Raginei.

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.510
Noei?

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:16.240
I've been aiming to establish contact with the young officers of the Royal Guard.

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:19.210
That's where I heard the name Noei.

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:21.540
At this rate, something may happen.

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:23.300
Something may happen?

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:28.030
In one faction of the military, there are people who are dissatisfied with Somand taking the throne.

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:30.160
Will there be a coup d'état?

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:33.700
I'm trying to contact Noei because I want to know the same thing.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:36.570
If you hear from him, let me know!

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:40.050
Hey! Eddie!

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:42.140
See ya, got work to get back to!

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:50.010
<i>Things are already in a sorry state, the very day of the coronation...</i>

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:53.510
<i>I don't care what becomes of Somand...</i>

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:58.670
<i>but, beyond sheltering Rumaty, Kajika won't be able to stay out of it...</i>

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.880
Disguise ourselves as Royal Guard and sneak into the Spring Palace?

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:04.780
I know it's reckless.

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:08.550
But His Highness Somand... no... His Majesty the King...

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:10.540
I have to talk to him.

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:12.280
That's impossible.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:16.100
Goslen... what are you talking about?

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:19.790
The daily morning audience with the Royal Guard has been suspended.

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:23.650
Nonsense! Discarding a ceremony with such tradition so lightly...

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:28.460
On the contrary, the entire composition of the guard has undergone a major change.

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:31.000
It's almost tripled in size...

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:34.540
and the word is that its authority exceeds even the national defense army...

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:38.940
In short, it's become an army that defends only the King.

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:43.430
But that... that makes them just like the Nazi S.S.!

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:48.680
His Majesty Somand is a person who hates change...

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:53.590
If the guard is being drastically changed, it's not His Majesty's idea!

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.900
Someone must be hinting to him from the shadows...

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.750
That--that would be...

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:02.600
<i>Whoever seizes the military controls the nation.</i>

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:06.590
<i>The King carries tremendous authority in the Kingdom of Raginei...</i>

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:11.080
<i>What on earth would someone intend to do with all that power?</i>

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:14.130
<i>Quinza, after all...</i>

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:16.210
<i>is this your doing?</i>

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:23.910
Your Majesty... what is the matter?

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:27.230
Q--Quinza?

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:30.060
It is the role of Grand Chamberlain Kanan...

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.480
to come and get the King and take him to the ceremony.

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:34.940
You mustn't send him away.

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:37.490
I won't have anyone but you!

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:38.690
Yes!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:42.520
You will be Grand Chamberlain, starting now!

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:47.300
Preposterous... there is procedure for these things.

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:50.670
Besides, I would not be the least fit for it.

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:53.950
If it's not you, I'm in trouble!

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:55.220
I'm...

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:58.010
scared, Quinza...

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:00.130
Of what, Your Majesty?

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:03.480
Being King is impossible for me!

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:07.430
All that responsibility coming to hang over me...

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:08.940
I'm scared!

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:10.580
Don't be foolish...

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:15.520
With this, Your Majesty becomes in truth the most powerful person in Raginei.

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:19.280
No one can tell Your Majesty what to do anymore.

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:23.350
Now you can wield your power and reform your country to your heart's content.

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:28.230
Quinza, stay by my side! Help me!

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:31.670
Of course. To the best of my meager abilities.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:34.250
Q--Quinza...

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:45.590
Master Kanan, if we don't hurry...

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:47.520
The time for the coronation...

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:49.540
I know!

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:55.180
His Majesty is coming...

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:01.200
S--sorry to worry you all.

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:02.790
Oh, Your Majesty!

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.650
Amazing, Master Quinza...

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:05.780
Your Highness...

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:10.470
<i>Of course I will help you, Your Majesty...</i>

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:14.510
<i>We'll use that hand to craft a new Raginei.</i>

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:20.150
<i>And besides, Your Majesty's cooperation is necessary...</i>

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:23.240
<i>Oh, Lord... please accept this...</i>

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:29.010
<i>for this King will be my offering to you.</i>

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:56.440
They're here.

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:00.860
I heard the actual crowning will occur just at dawn.

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:02.620
I see...

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:06.630
<i>I can't see very well, but I wonder if Najayra is there too?</i>

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:10.610
<i>If so, Rumaty ought to be there, too.</i>

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:15.160
<i>Rumaty... I wonder how's he feeling as he watches this?</i>

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:22.710
<i>Kajika... the one who should be up there is you.</i>

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:26.820
<i>And then the one who should have been King, Harry...</i>

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:30.040
<i>What does fate have in store?</i>

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:33.480
Inside the temple of the Royal Palace...

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:37.140
the line of the royal family is proceeding quietly down the center.

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:41.760
The rite of coronation will be held in the stately manner prescribed...

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:44.050
by a thousand years of tradition.

00:22:45.330 --> 00:22:48.480
In front of the Palace, citizens holding lanterns...

00:22:48.550 --> 00:22:52.080
eagerly await the creation of the new King.

00:22:52.430 --> 00:22:54.440
When dawn comes in Raginei...

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:57.850
the voices of even greater jubilation will resound.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
